/surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Mackenzie</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Dudley-Brown</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Case management: a review of the definitions and practices</article-title><source>J Adv Nurs</source><year>1998</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>933</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9637319</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-2648.1998.t01-1-00566.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zander</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nursing case management in the 21st century: intervening where margin meets mission</article-title><source>Nurs Adm Q</source><year>2002</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>58</fpage><lpage>67</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12515234</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huber</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The diversity of case management models</article-title><source>Lippincotts Case Manag</source><year>2002</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>212</fpage><lpage>20</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12478222</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00129234-200211000-00002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Commission for Case Manager Certification</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ccmcertification.org/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Taylor</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comprehensive nursing case management. An advanced practice model</article-title><source>Nurs Case Manag</source><year>1999</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>2</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10232216</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Lucey</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Case management "within the walls": a glimpse into the future</article-title><source>Crit Care Nurs Q</source><year>2005</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>162</fpage><lpage>78</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15875446</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Owen</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An important perspective on the case manager's role</article-title><source>Lippincotts Case Manag</source><year>2006</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>2</fpage><lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16444116</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huber</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hall</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Vaughn</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Dose of case management interventions</article-title><source>Lippincotts Case Manag</source><year>2001</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>119</fpage><lpage>26</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16397997</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00129234-200105000-00006</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goodwin</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Satish</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name><name><surname>Nattinger</surname><given-names>AB</given-names></name><name><surname>Freeman</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of nurse case management on the treatment of older women with breast cancer</article-title><source>J Am Geriatr Soc</source><year>2003</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>1252</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12919237</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1532-5415.2003.51409.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Elbourne</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Altman</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CONSORT statement: extension to cluster randomised trials</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2004</year><volume>328</volume><fpage>702</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15031246</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/bmj.328.7441.702</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Altman</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulz</surname><given-names>KF</given-names></name><name><surname>Moher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Egger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidoff</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Elbourne</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>The revised CONSORT statement for reporting randomized trials: explanation and elaboration</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>134</volume><fpage>663</fpage><lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11304107</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>The Impact of Short Term Case Management on Cancer Patients' Concrete Needs and Quality of Life</article-title><source>Advances in Medical Sociology</source><year>1995</year><fpage>269</fpage><lpage>94</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ritz</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Nissen</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Swenson</surname><given-names>KK</given-names></name><name><surname>Farrell</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Sperduto</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name><name><surname>Sladek</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Effects of advanced nursing care on quality of life and cost outcomes of women diagnosed with breast cancer</article-title><source>Oncol Nurs Forum</source><year>2000</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>923</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10920832</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McCorkle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Strumpf</surname><given-names>NE</given-names></name><name><surname>Nuamah</surname><given-names>IF</given-names></name><name><surname>Adler</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cooley</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Jepson</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>A specialized home care intervention improves survival among older post-surgical cancer patients</article-title><source>J Am Geriatr Soc</source><year>2000</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>1707</fpage><lpage>13</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11129765</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McCorkle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Benoliel</surname><given-names>JQ</give